  "about": {
    "metaTitle": "About — Lukka Place",
    "metaDescription": "How Lukka Place, Kinshasa's property listings platform, works.",
    "eyebrow": "About",
    "title": "A platform built for Kinshasa",
    "lead": "Agents and private owners submit their properties over WhatsApp. Every listing is structured, verified, then published.",
    "body1": "Lukka Place is a property listings platform dedicated to Kinshasa. Agents and private owners submit their properties directly over WhatsApp — text or photos — and every listing is structured and then verified before being published on the site.",
    "body2": "The aim is simple: to give people looking for an apartment, a villa or a plot in Kinshasa one single, up-to-date place where every listing corresponds to a property that is genuinely available — and a direct way to get in touch about a property, with no account and no form.",
    "body3": "Prices are set in US dollars. The Congolese franc display is an indicative estimate, converted at a dated reference rate that is updated manually, and is never presented as the contractual price.",
    "body4": "Lukka Place does not provide direct financial brokerage services; the platform facilitates introductions between advertisers and interested parties via listing reference."
  },
